{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1335784-multiple-instance-merits","id":1335784,"title":"Multiple instance merits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-14T13:43:03-07:00","id":1335784,"title":"Multiple instance merits","content":"Can a character have multiple instances of the Mystery Cult Initiation, or the Professional Training merit? Several merits specify that multiple instances are allowed but those two are not clear about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T13:58:49-07:00","id":1335788,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't flat disallow it. But keep in mind the implied social prerequisites of these two Merits: you are an <i>actively practicing and networking professional</i> or a <i>member of a full-on cult.</i> Simultaneously being both a full-time lawyer and a teaching professor is going to be hell of a time commitment, and most cults are pretty jealous of your commitments to anything that isn't the cult. Fail to meet your commitments and you fall out of practice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T14:11:27-07:00","id":1335789,"title":"","content":"There's nothing explicitly stopping this, but it would be hard to justify for most characters. Multiple instances of Professional Training means you have, at a minimum, done years of training in one job, stopped doing it but maintain your skills and relationships with members of that profession, and then restart an entirely new profession. Being in multiple Cults means juggling groups that are likely to kick you out if they find out you're involved with a different group as well.<br /> <br /> In general the devs have taken a, &quot;pick what makes sense for your story and group&quot; for questions like this rather than worrying about a hard line rule to set.<br /> <br /> The only real reason to even worry about these two Merits is that they're mechanically iffy more than the conceptual side of things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T14:46:24-07:00","id":1335795,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T15:16:48-07:00","id":1335799,"title":"","content":"I will point out, since it's relatively fresh in my reading: the 1e gameline that Professional Training originated from <i>does</i> have a hard one-Profession-at-a-time limit baked in, so the precedent is not strongly in favor of double-dipping.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}